" ''Added Walrii. These feisty badboys chillax on beaches. They are agressive, swim, and should quite generally be approached with a fair bit of prejudice.'' " ~ Jorb

Large, fat and tough creatures resting on beaches. Walrii are aggressive, and will likely engage in combat with nearby players.

Walrus are slow on land and can be easily outrun on a horse, however, in water they require a [[Snekkja]] or [[Knarr]], as they are quicker than a rowboat and low quality ships, and, in rare occasions, faster than a Snekkja.

Walrus are able to inflict [[Seal Finger|Seal Finger]] [[wounds]] with their attacks, additionally these can also be obtained from butchering their corpses. The chance for wound from butchering is reduced if wearing [[Poor Man's Gloves]] or [[Plate Gauntlets]].

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Aggresive, initiating attack with a walrus will also get the attention of other nearby walrus.

