===Strategy===

Do not attempt to fight more than a single Walrus at once, if fighting a group, try to line them up and attack only one at once .

If fighting in water, be incredibly aware that they use a restoration (See Combat Moves > Tail Splash) that can deal damage in a small area around the Walrus, so the above tactic is a must-do or else you will be hit real hard.

Preferably fight them on a Horse, as they are relatively slow outside water.

